<p id="mwCQ">The <b id="mwCg">twenty-first season</b> of <i id="mwCw"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Bachelorette_(American_TV_series)" title="The Bachelorette (American TV series)" id="mwDA">The Bachelorette</a></i> premiered on July 8, 2024.<sup about="#mwt9" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-1"}}'><a href="#cite_note-1" id="mwDQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwDg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwDw">[</span>1<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwEA">]</span></span></a></sup> This season features 26-year-old <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jenn_Tran" title="Jenn Tran" id="mwEQ">Jennifer "Jenn" Tran</a>, a <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Physician_assistant" title="Physician assistant" id="mwEg">physician assistant</a> student from <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hillsdale,_New_Jersey" title="Hillsdale, New Jersey" id="mwEw">Hillsdale, New Jersey</a>.<sup about="#mwt12" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-NJ_2-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"NJ"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-NJ-2"}}'><a href="#cite_note-NJ-2" id="mwFA"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwFQ"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwFg">[</span>2<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwFw">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id="mwGA">Tran finished in fifth place on the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Bachelor_(American_season_28)" title="The Bachelor (American season 28)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwGQ">28th season</a> of <i id="mwGg"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Bachelor_(American_TV_series)" title="The Bachelor (American TV series)" id="mwGw">The Bachelor</a></i> featuring <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Joey_Graziadei" title="Joey Graziadei" id="mwHA">Joey Graziadei</a>. She is the first <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Asian-American" title="Asian-American" class="mw-redirect" id="mwHQ">Asian-American</a> and the first practicing <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Buddhist" title="Buddhist" class="mw-redirect" id="mwHg">Buddhist</a> in the lead role in the history of the <i id="mwHw">Bachelor</i> franchise.<sup about="#mwt15" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-Announcement_3-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"Announcement"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-Announcement-3"}}'><a href="#cite_note-Announcement-3" id="mwIA"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwIQ"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwIg">[</span>3<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwIw">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt18" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-Buddhist_4-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"Buddhist"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-Buddhist-4"}}'><a href="#cite_note-Buddhist-4" id="mwJA"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwJQ"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwJg">[</span>4<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwJw">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id="mwKA">The season concluded on September 3, 2024, with Tran and her final choice, 28-year-old freight company owner Devin Strader, proposing to each other. However, during the live <i id="mwKQ">After the Final Rose</i> special, Tran revealed that Strader broke up with her in August 2024.<sup about="#mwt21" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-5" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-5"}}'><a href="#cite_note-5" id="mwKg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwKw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwLA">[</span>5<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwLQ">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id="mwLg">It is the most recent season of <i id="mwLw">The Bachelorette</i> that has been aired following the subsequent <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Bachelorette_(American_TV_series)_season_22" title="The Bachelorette (American TV series) season 22" id="mwMA">twenty-second season</a> was pulled out from airing on March 19, 2026, less than two years after this season aired.<sup about="#mwt24" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-6" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-6"}}'><a href="#cite_note-6" id="mwMQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwMg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwMw">[</span>6<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwNA">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<meta property="mw:PageProp/toc" id="mwNQ" data-mw='{"autoGenerated":true}'/></section><section data-mw-section-id="1" id="mwNg" aria-labelledby="Production"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Production">Production</h2><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=The_Bachelorette_(American_TV_series)_season_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1" title="Edit section: Production"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>

<section data-mw-section-id="2" id="mwNw" aria-labelledby="Casting_and_contestants"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Casting_and_contestants">Casting and contestants</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=The_Bachelorette_(American_TV_series)_season_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2" title="Edit section: Casting and contestants"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwOA">On March 25, 2024, Tran was announced as the Bachelorette by previous lead <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Charity_Lawson" title="Charity Lawson" id="mwOQ">Charity Lawson</a> during the <i id="mwOg">After the Final Rose</i> special of the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Bachelor_(American_season_28)" title="The Bachelor (American season 28)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwOw">28th season</a> of <i id="mwPA"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Bachelor_(American_TV_series)" title="The Bachelor (American TV series)" id="mwPQ">The Bachelor</a></i>.<sup about="#mwt25" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-Announcement_3-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"Announcement"}}'><a href="#cite_note-Announcement-3" id="mwPg"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwPw"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwQA">[</span>3<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwQQ">]</span></span></a></sup> Her fellow season 28 castmates <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Daisy_Kent" title="Daisy Kent" id="mwQg">Daisy Kent</a> and Maria Georgas were also considered for the role.<sup about="#mwt28" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-7" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-7"}}'><a href="#cite_note-7" id="mwQw"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwRA"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwRQ">[</span>7<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwRg">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id="mwRw">Notable contestants include Aaron Erb, who is the twin brother of <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Bachelorette_(American_season_16)" title="The Bachelorette (American season 16)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwSA">season 16</a> and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bachelor_in_Paradise_(American_season_7)" title="Bachelor in Paradise (American season 7)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwSQ"><i id="mwSg">Bachelor in Paradise 7</i></a> contestant Noah Erb, and Caleb "Moze" Smith, who played for the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Iowa_Barnstormers" title="Iowa Barnstormers" id="mwSw">Iowa Barnstormers</a> in the <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Indoor_Football_League" title="Indoor Football League" id="mwTA">Indoor Football League</a>.<sup about="#mwt31" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-Aaron_8-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"Aaron"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-Aaron-8"}}'><a href="#cite_note-Aaron-8" id="mwTQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwTg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwTw">[</span>8<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwUA">]</span></span></a></sup><sup about="#mwt34" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-Moze_9-0" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"Moze"},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-Moze-9"}}'><a href="#cite_note-Moze-9" id="mwUQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwUg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwUw">[</span>9<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwVA">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="3" id="mwVQ" aria-labelledby="Filming_and_development"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Filming_and_development">Filming and development</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=The_Bachelorette_(American_TV_series)_season_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3" title="Edit section: Filming and development"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwVg">Filming began on March 28, 2024, at the Hummingbird Nest Ranch in <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Santa_Susana,_California" title="Santa Susana, California" id="mwVw">Santa Susana, California</a>. This was previously the filming location for <i id="mwWA"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Bachelor_Presents:_Listen_to_Your_Heart" title="The Bachelor Presents: Listen to Your Heart" id="mwWQ">The Bachelor Presents: Listen to Your Heart</a></i>, making this is the first season since <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Bachelorette_(American_TV_series)_season_18" title="The Bachelorette (American TV series) season 18" id="mwWg">season 18</a> that did not start at the traditional Bachelor mansion in <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Agoura_Hills,_California" title="Agoura Hills, California" id="mwWw">Agoura Hills, California</a>.<sup about="#mwt37" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-10" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-10"}}'><a href="#cite_note-10" id="mwXA"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwXQ"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwXg">[</span>10<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwXw">]</span></span></a></sup> In April 2024, filming was reported at <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chihuly_Garden_and_Glass" title="Chihuly Garden and Glass" id="mwYA">Chihuly Garden and Glass</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pike_Place_Market" title="Pike Place Market" id="mwYQ">Pike Place Market</a>, <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pioneer_Square,_Seattle" title="Pioneer Square, Seattle" id="mwYg">Pioneer Square</a>, and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Space_Needle" title="Space Needle" id="mwYw">Space Needle</a> in <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Seattle" title="Seattle" id="mwZA">Seattle, Washington</a>.<sup about="#mwt40" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-11" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-11"}}'><a href="#cite_note-11" id="mwZQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwZg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwZw">[</span>11<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwaA">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

<p id="mwaQ">This season also includes visits to <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Melbourne" title="Melbourne" id="mwag">Melbourne, Australia</a> and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Auckland" title="Auckland" id="mwaw">Auckland, New Zealand</a>, with filming concluding in <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kailua-Kona,_Hawaii" title="Kailua-Kona, Hawaii" id="mwbA">Kailua-Kona, Hawaii</a> in mid-May.<sup about="#mwt43" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-12" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-12"}}'><a href="#cite_note-12" id="mwbQ"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwbg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwbw">[</span>12<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwcA">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

